# A home in Brill (mod-brill-home), ChromieCraft's realm: Cedric Harrow's house by Brill's north road,
# Jamie Nore's welcome and bed, the bed's sleep, the mastiff there on waking and made a warrior's hunter pet,
# and the furniture she has carried over. (Level 12: Mend Pet's first rank comes with the dog.)
cmd .levelup 11
cmd .modify money 100000
# At the house's door: Cedric is there for this character (phase 0x100 with the world's 1).
go 0 2289.1 361.2 34.7
wait 2
cmd .brillhome state
expect Brill home: phases 0x101 upgrades 0x0
talk 970110
accept 970110 970120
# Jamie Nore in the town hall: Cedric's quest turned in, the deed signed (done as it's taken), the bed.
go 0 2314.0 288.0 37.9
talk 2310
reward 2310 970120
talk 2310
accept 2310 970121
reward 2310 970121
talk 2310
accept 2310 970122
# Back at the house, inside: Cedric gone for this character, the bed there.
go 0 2288.3 352.9 35.7
wait 2
cmd .brillhome state
expect Brill home: phases 0x201 upgrades 0x0
# Asleep in it: lying down (stand state 3) on the bed, rested experience given.
cmd .brillhome sleep
expect Brill home: sleeping.
wait 4
cmd .brillhome state
has stand 3
has flags 0x1 pet 0
expect-not rested 0 stand
# The mastiff, there after the first night (its phase 0x400 with the bed's): fetch three times, a scratch
# behind the ears, and it's theirs: a hunter's pet for a warrior, with the pet spells.
cmd .brillhome state
expect Brill home: phases 0x601
talk 970112
accept 970112 970123
talk 970112
select 970112 Throw the stick
wait 8
talk 970112
select 970112 Throw the stick
wait 8
talk 970112
select 970112 Throw the stick
wait 8
talk 970112
select 970112 Scratch behind its ears
reward 970112 970123
wait 2
cmd .brillhome state
has flags 0x7 pet 970115 kind 1 hunterpets 1 callpet 1 mendpet 1 tame 0
expect Brill home: phases 0x201
# A hunter trainer (Ormak Grimshot, Orgrimmar) teaches the warrior to tame beasts.
go 1 2098.0 -4606.0 59.5
talk 3352
select 3352 tame beasts
cmd .brillhome state
expect tame 1
# The bed quest done: back to Jamie.
go 0 2314.0 288.0 37.9
talk 2310
reward 2310 970122
cmd .brillhome state
expect quests 111
# Her furniture: a bearskin rug, bought, in the house for this character.
talk 2310
select 2310 more of a home
select 2310 bearskin rug
go 0 2288.3 352.9 35.7
wait 2
cmd .brillhome state
expect Brill home: phases 0x4201 upgrades 0x4000
# Away from the house: the world's phase alone.
go 0 2314.0 288.0 37.9
wait 2
cmd .brillhome state
expect Brill home: phases 0x1 upgrades 0x4000
